{title: Tum Aaoge}
{artist: Soham Naik}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
Us pal [Cm] humne na roka tujhe,        [Cm] Shayad yeh bhi pata tha mujhe
Tum [A#] aaoge [Gm] yakeen tha,        [Cm] Mud ke kabhi to [Gm] yahan
Tum [Gm/D] aaoge [Gm] yakeen tha,        [Cm] Hone ko phir se mera haan [Gm] mera
[Cm] Kitni raatein ghuzri jaga ke,        [A#] Neendein [Cm] ho gayi [F] khafa
[Cm] Khwabo se tere bhar li hain aankhe,        [A#] Yaadon se [Cm] maine subah
Itna pyaar [A#] ho jayega dil ko [F] tumse,        [A#] Khabar hi nahi thi [Cm] hamein
Tum [A#] aaoge [Gm] yakeen tha,        [Cm] Mud ke kabhi to [Gm] yahan
Tum [Gm/D] aaoge [Gm] yakeen tha,        [Cm] Hone ko phir se mera, haan [Gm] mera
[Cm] Aane se tere khamosh dil mein,        [A#] Hone lagi halchal [F] ein
[Cm] Kabse kadam yeh tehre huye the,        [A#] Aao sath chal [F] chalein
Intezar [A#] me thi tumhari ye [F] saanse,        [A#] Mile tum to jeene [Cm] lage
Tum [A#] aaoge [Gm] yakeen tha,        [Cm] Mud ke kabhi to [Gm] yahan
Tum [Gm/D] aaoge [Gm] yakeen tha,        [Cm] Hone ko phir se mera
